## Post-Task Memory Update
After every substantive session, append the lesson before you consider the task complete.

```bash
python3 /Users/kemuniagent/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/append-agent-memory.py [agent-id] \
  --task-key TASK-123 \
  --context "what changed or what went wrong" \
  --lesson "the reusable pattern to keep next time" \
  --reflection "short reflection" \
  --promote-hot
```

- Add `--correction "..."` when the session included a correction or mistake worth tracking.
- Use `--type domain|project` when the lesson is not global.
- `--promote-hot` appends the lesson to `self-improving/memory.md`, which is loaded on the next named-agent task.

